<title>UK: LVMH sets 1.5 bln Ffr six-year bond.</title>
<headline>LVMH sets 1.5 bln Ffr six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Lyonnnais and JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LVMH MOET HENNESSY LOUIS VUITTON</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.25 PCT  MATURITY    14.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.76    PAY DATE    14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.21     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS/LUX DENOMS (K)10-100-1(M) SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.55</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
